ぇ…』\n〇『お姉ちゃんのばかぁあああ！』\n●『あぁはいはいお姉ちゃんはろろのこと愛してますよ～』\n〇『ぐすっほんと？愛してる？』\n●『ほんとほんと愛してる愛してる』\n〇『…適当言ってない？』\n●『どうすればいいのさぁ…』\n〇『もっと気持ち込めて』\n●『はぁ…お姉ちゃんはろろのこと大好きだよ』\n〇『私もおねぇちゃんすきぃ』", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@2106_66/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1377815, "client_id": 65838, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/18a8b857-8152-4619-8b62-2c5f7e867c54?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1780456130&Signature=jgzkAIs-WFurOWN4HlY9h2ygVRAiZ33DYw64WUOZpKHTl6DxnYeA5NYWqqbwbCCj8cZTVjruKUcQtJs1bopbevkC7fc2shNGXqc7Jcd6U7Gf9iCXWtUuw-pcojycqLoOUr2mek9IOhwappsh18vuMQMeuu0uOcaouIKF5i6PvCQWLBeTH49iRNCWpV7YA4oKDwR3ODFyNEp96lQaZgWRloyfUFYb6Iw6LnBeYdhxIi3k9MXduJcK1ymcTCZq2OUGnl1FUIjGRM6PW8A532Tv8tRJkYS-q99JEJhFNGKGAHPecozpXg5woGi3Edafm8rcTH4WhwEwWj-RqMoEarGubQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1401719543471349761%2FmP_ma6eZ.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81dfb0a537d34c11076fb366fbb9d9f8", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1401719543471349761%2FmP_ma6eZ.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81dfb0a537d34c11076fb366fbb9d9f8, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1401719543471349761%2FmP_ma6eZ.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1e23365bb88b07b338787cef4000ebe 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1401719543471349761%2FmP_ma6eZ.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1bfd6ceefa158c68f7dc3906e59802c4 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/643da907-0368-44f1-9581-60fa094091fe?response-content